ICOSale.setApprovedAsset
├── when called by the owner with a non-zero asset and flipping from false → true or vice versa
│   ├── it sets isApprovedAsset[_asset] = indicator
│   └── it emits PayAssetApprovalSet with correct parameters
├── when _asset is the zero address
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAddress and does not change state
├── when the indicator is already set to the requested value
│   └── it reverts with IndicatorAlreadySet and does not change state
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount and does not change state
